flowchart TB
    Main[cmd/shardpost: Composition Root]
    Main --> Config[config + logging + telemetry]
    Main --> Protocols[imapproto / pop3proto / sieve]
    Main --> LMTP[lmtpd]
    Main --> Engine[imapsieve.Engine]
    Protocols --> Auth[auth.Authenticator]
    LMTP --> Auth
    Protocols --> Model[model.User]
    LMTP --> Store[cephstore.Store / User]
    Store -. implements .-> Model
    Mem[memstore.Store / User] -. implements .-> Model
    Protocols --> Engine
    LMTP --> Sieve[sieve evaluation]
    Engine --> Sieve
    Sieve --> Fork[go-sieve fork]
    Sieve --> Programs[extprograms.Runner]
    Engine --> Worker[LearningWorker]
    Worker --> Queue[cephstore.LearningQueue]
    Worker --> Programs
    Store --> RADOS[librados / RADOS]
    Queue --> RADOS
